<title>JAPAN: Japan aluminium output, shipments rise in December.</title>
<headline>Japan aluminium output, shipments rise in December.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese output and shipments of fabricated aluminium products rose in December from the same period last year to record levels for that month, the Japan Aluminum Federation said on Monday.</p>
<p>The December data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		     Dec 96     yr/yr change    Nov 96 (revised)</p>
<p> Output	   203,375	+6.6 pct	 216,965 (+5.0 pct)</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled   95,023	+4.0 pct	 103,629 (+1.3)</p>
<p>   Extrusions   108,352	+9.1 pct	 113,336 (+8.6)</p>
<p> Shipments	200,693	+5.8 pct	 214,695 (+6.1)</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled   91,968	+1.4 pct	 101,711 (+2.8)</p>
<p>   Extrusions   108,725	+9.9 pct	 112,984 (+9.3)</p>
<p> Inventories     89,188     +11.5 pct	  86,389 (+9.5)</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled   74,732     +12.4 pct	  71,597 (+9.2)</p>
<p>   Extrusions    14,456	+7.0 pct	  14,792 (+11.2)</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
